nggaris Besi ; Material: Stainless Steel, Panjang: 30 cm, P 30 cm x L 3 cm x T 1 cm (90 cm3) 8. Stabilo ; Stabilo (Highlighter) ,warna : kuning, biru, hijau, merah, orange, pink, lavender (ungu) 9. Sticky Notes ; Trifelo, Jenis: Sticky Notes (Catatan Tempel), Ukuran: 76mm x 76mm (3 x 3 inci) 10. Tinta Stempel ; warna tinta : ungu (violet), body : plastik, P 11 cm x L 4 cm x T 4 cm (176 cm3)', 0, 'low', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 2108587);
